      "explanation": "When the carbonate reacts with HCl, it produces CO<sub>2</sub>, as shown in the following balanced equation:\n<br><br>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"38.645ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 17081.1 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(950,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1353.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1533,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3512.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4512.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(5012.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(1472,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7040.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(8318.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(8818.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\" transform=\"translate(917,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(1639,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(10957.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(11957.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(13144.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(14144.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(15144.5,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1533,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n<br><br>\nFrom the problem, we know that 1 g of the carbonate produces 0.01 mol of CO<sub>2</sub>. <br><br>To determine the molar mass of the carbonate, we can use the stoichiometry of the reaction:\n<br><br>\n1 mol of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.444ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3290.1 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(950,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1353.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1533,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> produces 1 mol of CO2.\n<br><br>\nSo, 0.01 mol of CO<sub>2</sub> corresponds to 0.01 mol of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.444ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3290.1 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(950,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1353.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4